{
  "name": "02 — Message Generator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "schedule",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [250, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 100],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 💬 Message Generator Workflow\n\nRuns every day at 9am.\n\nFor each lead WITHOUT messages, calls Claude AI to generate 4 personalised outreach messages.\n\n**Credentials needed:**\n- Google Sheets OAuth\n- Telegram Bot\n- Anthropic API key (in HTTP nodes)",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "readLeads",
      "name": "Read Leads Without Messages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [450, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "readRows",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "LEADS",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "filters": {},
        "options": {
          "returnAllColumns": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "filterNoMessages",
      "name": "Filter: No Messages Yet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [700, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Only process leads that don't have messages yet\nconst filtered = items.filter(item => {\n  const email = item.json.email || '';\n  const coldEmail = item.json.cold_email_message || '';\n  const businessName = item.json.business_name || '';\n  // Must have a business name and no cold email message yet\n  return businessName && !coldEmail;\n});\n\nif (filtered.length === 0) {\n  // Return a marker so downstream knows nothing to do\n  return [{ json: { nothing_to_do: true, count: 0 } }];\n}\n\nreturn filtered;"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "checkNothingToDo",
      "name": "Check If Nothing To Do",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [950, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.nothing_to_do }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equal"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nothingToDo",
      "name": "Nothing To Do - End",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1200, 150],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "splitLeads",
      "name": "Process Each Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1200, 400],
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note2",
      "name": "Sticky Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1450, 100],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🤖 Claude AI Generation\n\nFor each lead, we call Claude API to generate 4 messages:\n1. Cold email (formal, <100 words)\n2. LinkedIn DM (<60 words)\n3. Instagram DM (<50 words)\n4. Facebook message (<60 words)\n\nMessages mention business name, city, and actual Google rating.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "callClaude",
      "name": "Generate Messages via Claude",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1450, 400],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-api-key",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY"
            },
            {
              "name": "anthropic-version",
              "value": "2023-06-01"
            },
            {
              "name": "content-type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "body": {
          "model": "claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022",
          "max_tokens": 1500,
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "=You are an outreach copywriter. Generate 4 personalised outreach messages for this business:\n\nBusiness Name: {{ $json.business_name }}\nCity: {{ $json.city || $json.address }}\nGoogle Rating: {{ $json.rating }} stars\nTotal Reviews: {{ $json.total_reviews }}\nProfession: {{ $json.profession }}\n\nGenerate exactly these 4 messages. Return ONLY a valid JSON object with these exact keys:\n{\n  \"cold_email\": \"...\",\n  \"linkedin_dm\": \"...\",\n  \"instagram_dm\": \"...\",\n  \"facebook_message\": \"...\"\n}\n\nRules for ALL messages:\n- Mention the business name and city naturally\n- Reference their Google rating of {{ $json.rating }} stars\n- Never mention AI, automation, or software\n- End with a simple yes/no question\n- Sound human, warm and genuine\n\nCold email: Formal tone. Under 100 words. Subject line not needed.\nLinkedIn DM: Professional tone. Under 60 words.\nInstagram DM: Casual friendly tone. Under 50 words.\nFacebook message: Friendly conversational tone. Under 60 words.\n\nReturn ONLY the JSON object, no other text."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "parseResponse",
      "name": "Parse Claude Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1700, 400],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const leadData = $('Process Each Lead').item.json;\nconst claudeResponse = items[0].json;\n\nlet messages = {};\ntry {\n  const content = claudeResponse.content[0].text;\n  // Extract JSON from response\n  const jsonMatch = content.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\n  if (jsonMatch) {\n    messages = JSON.parse(jsonMatch[0]);\n  }\n} catch(e) {\n  messages = {\n    cold_email: 'Error generating message',\n    linkedin_dm: 'Error generating message',\n    instagram_dm: 'Error generating message',\n    facebook_message: 'Error generating message'\n  };\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...leadData,\n    cold_email_message: messages.cold_email || '',\n    linkedin_message: messages.linkedin_dm || '',\n    instagram_message: messages.instagram_dm || '',\n    facebook_message: messages.facebook_message || '',\n    messages_generated_date: new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]\n  }\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "updateSheets",
      "name": "Update Google Sheets with Messages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [1950, 400],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "LEADS",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "business_name": "={{ $json.business_name }}",
            "cold_email_message": "={{ $json.cold_email_message }}",
            "linkedin_message": "={{ $json.linkedin_message }}",
            "instagram_message": "={{ $json.instagram_message }}",
            "facebook_message": "={{ $json.facebook_message }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": ["business_name"],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loopBack",
      "name": "Loop Back",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1950, 550],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "completionTelegram",
      "name": "Send Completion Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1950, 700],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "✅ Message Generator Complete!\n\nMessages have been generated for all leads without messages.\n\nCheck your Google Sheets LEADS tab to review them.",
        "additionalFields": {}
      }
    }
